:R-HSA-8978868  a           owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0006631 ;
        rdfs:comment        "The synthesis and breakdown of fatty acids are a central part of human energy metabolism, and the eicosanoid class of fatty acid derivatives regulate diverse processes in the body (Vance & Vance 2008 - URL). Processes annotated in this module include the synthesis of fatty acids from acetyl-CoA, mitochondrial and peroxisomal breakdown of fatty acids, and the metabolism of eicosanoids and related molecules." ;
        rdfs:label          "Fatty acid metabolism" ;
